// Hyrule isn't tagged yet (see website/docs/reference/roadmap.md, Fase 1).
// A real external consumer would instead pin a released version:
//   require github.com/Gui-Rondon/hyrule v0.101.0
// and drop this line entirely.
replace github.com/Gui-Rondon/hyrule => ../..
